# Xcode build products — this directory reaches 500 MB+
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserdatad/
xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/

# Your own signing / bundle id, if you use an xcconfig
Local.xcconfig

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Menu content and tuning pulled off a device — yours, not the repo's
*-presets.json
*-items.json

# Your signing identity — never commit this
Config/Local.xcconfig
Config/local.env

# ── licensed audio ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# The bubble clips come from an Epidemic Sound subscription. That licence covers
# USING them in a production; it does not cover redistributing the raw files,
# which is exactly what a public repo does. So the sounds stay on this machine
# and `MenuAudio` treats them as optional: with no clips in the bundle the app
# runs silent rather than failing to build.
#
# Drop your own .wav files into Sources/Sounds/ and they are picked up by name.
Sources/Sounds/
*.mp3
